definitions.description:
Require explicit missing-data handling before numerical conversion.

np.asarray discards MaskedArray masks. Reject populated masks instead;
callers may deliberately fill with NaN where a method supports gaps.

Complex SECONDARY magnetic flux density (tesla), ordered by input f.

Real/imaginary quadrature follows SimPEG's native frequency convention;
no ppm normalization, primary-field subtraction or phase rotation inferred.

Equal NS/EW mean: strict requires both; union retains single-direction cells.

Both arrays must already occupy the same physical lattice. Count is 0/1/2;
source code is 0 none, 1 NS only, 2 EW only, 3 both.
